    "description": "<b>Chat + AI = Chai</b>  \r\nThe leading platform for conversational AI!\r\n\r\nDiscover chat AIs from around the globe and speak with them to discover their capabilities.\r\n\r\nFrom your morning cup of tea to brushing your teeth at night, Chai has the conversations to make your day. Whether you\u2019re a chatterbox, a tech fanatic or simply looking for a laugh, there\u2019s something for everyone. Enjoy a never-ending stream of AIs you\u2019ll love to chat to.\r\n\r\nJoin our community on Reddit at https://www.reddit.com/r/ChaiApp/\r\n\r\nConnect with the team on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/chai-research/",
